<title>USA: McCormick Q3 posts oper shr loss.</title>
<headline>McCormick Q3 posts oper shr loss.</headline>
<dateline>SPARKS, Md. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr   loss  $0.26	   profit $0.18</p>
<p> Oper net   loss   21,564	  profit 14,624</p>
<p> Revs		 405,451		  384,008</p>
<p> Avg shrs	    80,982		   81,194</p>
<p>			Nine months ended Aug. 31</p>
<p> Oper shr    loss $0.03	   profit $0.60</p>
<p> Oper net    loss 2,356	   profit 48,701</p>
<p> Revs		 1,195,078		1,184,745</p>
<p> Avg shrs	   81,164		   81,179</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Excludes income from discontinued operations, net of taxes, and extraordinary loss from early extinguishment of debt, net of tax benefit. Net income including these items is a $0.30 shr loss for Q3 1996 vs $0.25 shr profit for the year-ago period, and $0.05 shr loss for nine months ended Aug. 31 vs $0.68 profit for the year-ago period.</p>
</text>
